        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "words": 21,
      "text": "The first work that it does is this: It incinerates and burns wood, and everything that shall be placed upon it.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "words": 18,
      "text": "The second: It separates four aspects of the wood, which are these: fire and light, ash and smoke.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "words": 29,
      "text": "The third: It gives a taste and an {aroma} to whatever will be cooked on it. It also gives heat and cheer to whoever will be close to it.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
      },
      "seam": {
        "has_bridge_connective": false,
        "bridge_phrase": null,
        "institutional_terms_found": [],
        "register_shift": false,
        "seam_flag": false,
        "seam_note": null
      }
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "words": 18,
      "text": "The fourth work that [it] does: All craftsmen shall work the utensils that they will fabricate in it.",
      "scores": {
        "substrate": 0.0,
        "dialogue_frame": 0.0,
        "editorial_bridge": 0.0,
        "institutional": 0.0,
        "exhortation": 0.0
